WiFi & BlueTooth Module
-----------------------

|Product| is equipped with the popular **SKO.WBM80X2P.2 WiFi/BT module** which supports BT/BLE 2.1/3.0/4.x/5.3/5.4, as well as 802.11ax/ac/a/b/g/n 600Mbps 2.4/5.8 GHz Wireless LAN (WLAN).

